update public.questions set question_text = $cm$From the "Vectors" notes, which statement appears?$cm$, options = to_jsonb(array[$cm$"Must include" pairs: choose the required items first, then choose freely from the remainder$cm$::text, $cm$Piecewise densities carry an unknown k: impose that the total area is 1 (and continuity at joins where required). One equation, one unknown$cm$::text, $cm$A vector a = 3i + 4j has magnitude |a| = √(3² + 4²) = 5. Parallel vectors are scalar multiples; unit vector = a/|a|$cm$::text, $cm$The critical region is the set of values of the test statistic that would lead to rejection$cm$::text]::text[]), correct_option = 2, explanation = $cm$From the Vectors study notes: “A vector a = 3i + 4j has magnitude |a| = √(3² + 4²) = 5. Parallel vectors are scalar multiples; unit vector = a/|a|”.$cm$ where id = '48c55906-6214-430e-ba32-f9b019c17071';
