update public.questions set question_text = $cm$Which statement is NOT in the "Astronomy and Cosmology" study notes?$cm$, options = to_jsonb(array[$cm$Exponential: V = V₀ e^(−t/RC). Time constant RC: after one RC, V falls to 37%. Half-life t½ = 0.69 RC$cm$::text, $cm$Luminosity L is total power radiated (W). Intensity at distance d: I = L/(4πd²) — the key to distances$cm$::text, $cm$Standard candles (Cepheid variables, Type Ia supernovae) have known L, so measuring I gives d$cm$::text, $cm$Wien: λ_max T = 2.9 × 10⁻³ m K — hotter stars are bluer$cm$::text]::text[]), correct_option = 0, explanation = $cm$The other three are all in the Astronomy and Cosmology study notes; this one is not.$cm$ where id = '228637d8-f905-4374-a7ee-a5089ce595bb';
