update public.questions set question_text = $cm$Which of these is covered by the "Circular Measure" study notes?$cm$, options = to_jsonb(array[$cm$Reverse the power rule and add a constant: ∫ xⁿ dx = xⁿ⁺¹/(n+1) + c (n ≠ −1)$cm$::text, $cm$Common angles: 30° = π/6, 45° = π/4, 60° = π/3, 90° = π/2, 180° = π, 360° = 2π$cm$::text, $cm$The tangent gradient at a point is dy/dx there; the normal gradient is −1/(dy/dx)$cm$::text, $cm$(1 + x)ⁿ = 1 + nx + n(n − 1)/2! x² + n(n − 1)(n − 2)/3! x³ + …, valid for |x| < 1$cm$::text]::text[]), correct_option = 1, explanation = $cm$From the Circular Measure study notes: “Common angles: 30° = π/6, 45° = π/4, 60° = π/3, 90° = π/2, 180° = π, 360° = 2π”.$cm$ where id = 'b070dee6-1d8e-4530-a832-aef5e219401c';
