update public.questions set question_text = $cm$Which statement is NOT in the "Hypothesis Testing" study notes?$cm$, options = to_jsonb(array[$cm$Plot z as the point (a, b). |z| = √(a² + b²) is the modulus (distance from origin); arg z = tan⁻¹(b/a) is the argument (angle). Multiply two numbers: $cm$::text, $cm$The null hypothesis H₀ is the default claim (no change, p = p₀). The alternative H₁ is what a suspicious observation suggests (p > p₀, p < p₀, or p ≠ $cm$::text, $cm$H₀: p = 0.3 against H₁: p > 0.3, observed 10 successes in n = 20$cm$::text, $cm$Compute P(X ≥ 10) under B(20, 0.3). If that tail probability is below α, reject H₀$cm$::text]::text[]), correct_option = 0, explanation = $cm$The other three are all in the Hypothesis Testing study notes; this one is not.$cm$ where id = 'd662b0e0-8d55-4ba9-8cfc-14e100129bb5';
