update public.questions set question_text = $cm$Which statement is from the "Number — Arithmetic and Place Value" study notes?$cm$, options = to_jsonb(array[$cm$HCF = product of common prime factors (lowest powers); LCM = all prime factors (highest powers)$cm$::text, $cm$Even/odd, triangular (½n(n+1)), squares, cubes, Fibonacci-type (each term = sum of previous two), geometric (×r)$cm$::text, $cm$Quote the reason in brackets every time: "∠ACB = 62° (angles in same segment)"$cm$::text, $cm$Match bases: 2ˣ = 32 ⇒ 2ˣ = 2⁵ ⇒ x = 5. With different bases, rewrite (8 = 2³)$cm$::text]::text[]), correct_option = 0, explanation = $cm$From the Number — Arithmetic and Place Value study notes: “HCF = product of common prime factors (lowest powers); LCM = all prime factors (highest powers)”.$cm$ where id = '3206b1bb-849d-479b-9345-081a442bba71';
