update public.questions set question_text = $cm$Which statement is from the "Number — Ratio, Rate and Proportion" study notes?$cm$, options = to_jsonb(array[$cm$Cambridge IGCSE 0580 (2025–2027): ratio notation, sharing, direct & inverse proportion (including squares/cubes), unit rates$cm$::text, $cm$Bar charts, pie charts (angle = fraction × 360°), time series, pictograms. Compare data sets with like-for-like totals; comment on trends$cm$::text, $cm$P(event) = favourable/total; 0 ≤ P ≤ 1; P(not A) = 1 − P(A). Probabilities of a complete set sum to 1 — use to find a missing probability$cm$::text, $cm$Midpoint of AB = ½(a + b). Prove collinearity: show AB = k·BC (shared point). Prove parallelogram: AB = DC. Use route paths: AC = AB + BC$cm$::text]::text[]), correct_option = 0, explanation = $cm$From the Number — Ratio, Rate and Proportion study notes: “Cambridge IGCSE 0580 (2025–2027): ratio notation, sharing, direct & inverse proportion (including squares/cubes), unit rates”.$cm$ where id = '58aea867-a5c4-4e76-9076-0af309d3bd19';
